{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10293180","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10293180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1029318001:0":{"text":"수녀님, 진정하세요. 무슨 일이 있었는지 말해주시겠어요?","source_cn":"修女，请冷静下来。告诉我们，发生了什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E75C1BE380E9ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029318002:1":{"text":"영지에 물이 떨어져서 게일이 물을 떠 오겠다고 나섰어요. 그런데 몇 시간이 지나도 돌아오지를 않아서...","source_cn":"是这样，营地中的水用完了，盖尔迪自告奋勇去取水，但是几...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13FA58B95AD88319","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029318003:1":{"text":"물만 떠오는 거라면 벌써 돌아오고도 남을 시간이에요! 도중에 사고라도 당한 게 아닌지 걱정돼요...","source_cn":"如果只是取水，他应该早就回来了才对！现在这样，怕是遇到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x865D0EF977DA8680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029318004:2":{"text":"이 근처엔 몬스터가 많아요. 어쩌면 게일이 위험에 빠졌을지도 모르겠어요.","source_cn":"这附近有不少魔物，盖尔迪有可能陷入了危险境地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F71F951B1B390D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029318005:2":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 저희와 같이 수도사를 찾아주시겠어요?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2491896211CEDA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_